    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5699" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφηρεφής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέφω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>covered on both sides, close-covered,</i> epith. of
