					Agath.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάδιον ἀ. ὕλαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zos.
					2.50
				</span></i>
			.</div>
